		"description": "<p><em>Nim+ Volume I variant rule (TwinSteel): alternative starting equipment for the Berserker.</em></p><p>Take this set <strong>instead of</strong> the Berserker’s standard starting equipment. Dropping this kit on your character grants:</p><ul><li>Club</li><li>Some Hefty Rocks</li><li>Wolf Pelt</li><li>Fanged Necklace</li></ul><p>Afterwards you may delete this kit item (the granted gear stays), and remember to remove the standard starting equipment if your character already received it.</p>",
